<h1>Home page</h1>
<div class="homepageDescription">
    <p>Developed by Cameron Kuykendall and James Cecconi GreenLeaf Plant Care is creating a website to help plant owners manage and track their indoor and outdoor collections.
     The estimated registered users will be in the 1,000-2,000-member range and will comprise an estimated 10,000 - 20,000 individual plants across all users. 
     Our website will support 150-250 plant species to add to their collections Users can record watering, fertilizing, pruning, repotting, and pest treatments. 
     These events will result in an estimated 100,000 logs per year. Our database will also assist in tracking the inventory of fertilizers, pesticides, and other treatments, 
     including when each treatment was applied and how much product was used. By organizing the plant information, watering times, fertilization, and care schedules, 
     our website will help users keep their plants healthy and better manage their growing plants</p>
</div>